Z||000009||onfire||03-01-2001||03:31 AM||||I was sleeping when it happened. I thought someone was trying to wake me up. When It was about half over I noticed the walls were moving.  Thought I was dreaming the whole thing. Amazingly enough there was no damage here. I even went to work. Just got home. My sister and her family live in Tacoma, and my brother and his family live in Olympia. They are all o.k. and doing fine also.||||reg||1
